ority separation, and forbidden side-effect counters.\n\n## Boundary Readback\n\n- `structured_native_primary_display = true`\n- `source_ms_screenshot_default_primary_display = false`\n- `source_ms_screenshot_primary_display_allowed = false`\n- Candidate MS screenshots are not student-display eligible.\n- Accepted+rights-allowed source screenshots remain secondary evidence only.\n- Missing MS degrades review/feedback but does not block attempts.\n- Payload display, structured feedback display, official MS text display, official MS image display, evidence drawer display, and answer-fact use are separate gates.\n- Accepted structured mark points do not imply released deterministic scoring authority.\n\n## Side-Effect Receipt\n\n- Production Supabase mutation count: `0`\n- Remote Supabase mutation count: `0`\n- Remote disposable Supabase write count: `0`\n- Production RAG reindex count: `0`\n- Vector store mutation count: `0`\n- External model/API/VLM call count: `0`\n- Full frontend UI integration count: `0`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-review-boundary.test.js --verbose`\n- `npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-review-boundary.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-review-boundary.test.js`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-review-boundary.mjs`\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n","created_at":"2026-07-07T13:19:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T15:49:11Z","closed_at":"2026-07-07T15:49:10Z","merged_at":"2026-07-07T15:49:10Z","merge_commit_sha":"9781a7491b321a2a32e697a4d19331c72efaa1f7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1440/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1440/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sa